    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with hospital's existing information systems and user directories: FULLY COVERED our architecture is API-first, allowing for seamless integration with existing systems through REST APIs and webhooks. our also support integration with user directories via SAML, OIDC, LDAP, and Entra ID. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU: FULLY COVERED our can host our solution on OuraneCloud's Sovereign HDS tier, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and located within the EU. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No dependency on non-European suppliers: FULLY COVERED our sovereign European open-weight model is hosted by our, ensuring no dependency on non-European suppliers. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "High level of answer relevance: FULLY COVERED Our platform Atelier provides a high level of answer relevance through Our platform Atelier retrieval-augmented generation capabilities and hybrid search functionality. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with hospital information system and electronic patient record: FULLY COVERED our support integration with hospital information systems and electronic patient records through our API-first approach and health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR). 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support for health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR): FULLY COVERED Our platform Atelier supports health interoperability standards, ensuring seamless communication between different healthcare systems. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Data sovereignty: FULLY COVERED our guarantee data sovereignty by hosting data within the EU and complying with relevant regulations such as GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture would involve deploying Our platform Atelier on OuraneCloud's Sovereign HDS tier, integrating Our platform Atelier with OuraneCloud's existing information systems and user directories through APIs, and ensuring compliance with all relevant healthcare standards and regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup would provide a highly available, secure, and sovereign solution that meets all of the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable), and all AI outputs must be explainable and auditable a posteriori." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision may be automated without explicit validation by an authorised professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The system must also comply with French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification and ensure the preservation of medical confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should The system flag, and are The system compliant?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on The system company context, I can confirm that The system holds ISO 27001 and ISO 27701 certifications, which demonstrate The system commitment to information security and privacy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, The system ISO 27701 certification covers the privacy information management extension, which includes requirements for GDPR compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data hosting, The system use OuraneCloud, a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud, as The system hosting partner. use ensures that all data is hosted within EU, and no transfers outside EU are made." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The system also implement encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256, which aligns with The tender requirements for protecting sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The system data protection measures include pseudonymisation, data minimisation, and configurable retention, which further support GDPR compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, The system have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register, ensuring that The system are transparent about The system data processing activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of explainability and auditability, The system product, Atelier, is designed to provide grounded-in-sources retrieval trace and audit log capabilities, supporting a posteriori review and understanding of AI outputs. designed aligns with The tender requirements for explainable and auditable AI outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The system also comply with French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification through The system hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud, a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud, which holds French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This ensures that The system meet the specific requirements for hosting health data in France and preserve medical confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I would flag one potential legal risk: ensuring that no decision is automated without explicit validation by an authorised professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While The system system is designed to provide support and assistance, it is crucial to ensure that all decisions are made by qualified professionals, with The system AI outputs serving only as recommendations or suggestions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, based on The system company context, I believe The system are compliant with The tender requirements regarding GDPR, HDS certification, explainability, auditability, and medical confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, it is essential to carefully review and address any potential legal risks associated with automated decision-making and ensure that our system is used in accordance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is €900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Annual operating costs must remain controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires a progressive deployment starting with a pilot phase in one or two departments and then gradually expanding to include all services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimisation strategies our can propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our annual revenue is €6,200,000 with a near break-even result, indicating a slight positive EBITDA. our has a Series A funding of €12,000,000, providing a comfortable cash runway." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's budget for this contract is €900,000. our standard daily rates range from €700 to €1,300 per day, depending on the role." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To determine our projected margin on this contract, our need to estimate the total number of days required to deliver the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming a moderate complexity project with a mix of roles, let's consider an average daily rate of €1,000." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The total contract value is €900,000, which translates to approximately 900 days of work (€900,000 / €1,000 per day). our target gross margin percentage is between 25% and 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve this, our would need to ensure that our costs, including personnel, infrastructure, and other expenses, do not exceed 65-75% of the contract value." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the progressive deployment requirement, our can propose a cost-optimisation strategy by: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Leveraging our existing resources and expertise to minimize additional hiring and training costs. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Implementing a phased approach, starting with a pilot phase in one or two departments, to reduce initial investment and allow for adjustments before scaling up. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Offering a sovereign HDS tier and a sovereign European model, which are more cost-efficient on the recurring side than premium high-availability tiers combined with top-tier proprietary inference. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Providing change management support and staff training to ensure a smooth transition and minimize additional costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By adopting these strategies, our can optimize costs while maintaining our target gross margin percentage." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more detailed information on the project specific requirements and our internal cost structure, it is challenging to provide an exact projected margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, our can aim to achieve a margin within our target range of 25-35% by carefully managing resources, leveraging our expertise, and implementing cost-efficient solutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an AI assistance solution that can support hospital staff in hospital staff daily activities, facilitate access to information, improve the quality of written outputs, and reduce processing and documentation times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The system must also provide drafting assistance, support medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10), and ensure continuity of care between professionals and services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we propose to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context at Faber IA, we can propose an AI assistance solution that leverages we retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities to support hospital staff in hospital staff daily activities. our retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities can facilitate access to information by retrieving relevant passages from The client controlled corpus, which includes care protocols, HAS recommendations, internal procedures, and regulatory texts." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve the quality of written outputs, we can utilize we template-guided drafting capability, which enables the generation of high-quality clinical and administrative content, such as discharge summaries, medical reports, and patient letters. we system can also assist with medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10) by providing structured extraction capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure continuity of care between professionals and services, we can propose we dossier-context continuity feature, which provides structured handover summaries that allow another professional or colleague to efficiently take over an in-progress dossier with full context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This feature is particularly useful for supporting the continuity of care between shifts and services. we innovation strategy involves an iterative approach, starting with corpus selection and curation, followed by retrieval tuning, prompt and template design, and evaluation loop. we can work closely with the client's experts to ensure that we solution meets the client's specific requirements and integrates seamlessly with the client's existing systems and workflows. we can also propose we sovereign European open-weight model, which is fully auditable and provides strong grounding behavior, making it well-suited for explainability-driven and sovereignty-driven requirements. it can be fine-tuned on the client's material to ensure optimal performance and compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, we proposed AI components and innovation strategy are designed to meet the client's requirements and improve the efficiency and quality of hospital staff's daily activities, while ensuring continuity of care and compliance with regulatory standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires the solution to contribute to reducing energy consumption, rely on low-carbon infrastructure, and comply with the authority's sustainable development policy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The environmental footprint of the information systems must also be limited." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure that the solution meets these sustainability requirements, and what eco-friendly features can we highlight in we bid?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability officer at Faber IA, I can confirm that Faber IA has a strong commitment to sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA have a published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year, and Faber IA report the deployment footprint to clients." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, uses renewable energy, has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, and reuses heat, which reduces waste and minimizes environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA also practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, which helps reduce energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Faber IA carbon reporting capability allows Faber IA to monitor and optimize Faber IA carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must take the dossier context into account where available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk160> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The tender sustainability requirements, Faber IA can highlight these eco-friendly features in our bid and emphasize Faber IA commitment to reducing energy consumption and relying on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA can also propose solutions that contribute to limiting the environmental footprint of the information systems, such as optimizing data storage and processing, and using energy-efficient hardware." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk162> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging Faber IA existing sustainability capabilities and emphasizing Faber IA dedication to environmentally responsible practices, Faber IA can demonstrate Faber IA ability to meet the tender's sustainability requirements and provide an eco-friendly solution that aligns with the authority's sustainable development policy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a progressive deployment with a pilot phase on a limited perimeter (one or two departments) followed by progressive generalization to all services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk164> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The contract must cover design, implementation, and deployment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What project management approach and governance structure can we propose to ensure the successful delivery of this project, and how will we manage the change management process for hospital staff? we can propose a Hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement. a Hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement will enable we to work closely with the client to ensure that the solution meets the client requirements and is delivered on time. this project will be divided into phases, including Framing, Design, Pilot, Generalisation, and Run, each ending with a formal review and a go/no-go decision." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk166> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of governance structure, we suggest establishing a Joint Steering Committee (Faber IA + client) that meets monthly, as well as an Operational Committee meeting fortnightly." ;
