        ex:hasText "For change management, we can provide additional resources, including change-management and training resources, to support hospital staff in adapting to the solution. we approach will focus on ensuring that the solution fits into existing practices of staff and does not introduce a rupture in clinical or administrative workflows. we will work closely with hospital staff to understand hospital staff needs and concerns and provide training and support to ensure a smooth transition." ;
